        "id": "p80-q8-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Find the mean, mode, and median.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p80-q8-a-supplied-answer",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Mean: ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "6.25",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "; mode: ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "7",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "; median: ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "6.5",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ".",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\bar{x}&=\\frac{6+10+4+7+8+7+6+5+7+8+7+5+6+4+3+7}{16}\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\frac{100}{16}\\\\\\bar{x}&=6.25\\end{align*}$$\nSize $7$ occurs five times, more than any other size, so the mode is $7$.\nIn ascending order:\n$$3,\\;4,\\;4,\\;5,\\;5,\\;6,\\;6,\\;6,\\;7,\\;7,\\;7,\\;7,\\;7,\\;8,\\;8,\\;10$$\nThe 8th and 9th values are $6$ and $7$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Median}&=\\frac{6+7}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=6.5\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      },
      {
        "id": "p80-q8-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "Explain why the mean is not useful for the shoe store owner.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p80-q8-b-supplied-answer",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The mean size of ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "6.25",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " does not identify the sizes customers buy most often, so it gives little guidance about which sizes to stock most.",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "The mean of $6.25$ averages the size numbers but does not show demand for individual sizes. It is not one of the sizes recorded in these sales and does not identify which size the owner should stock most.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 12
      },
